ToolType - A program to make it easier to edit tooltypes in icons.  ToolType will
           read the tooltypes from an icon file and let you use your favorite text
           editor to change or add to the tooltypes.  ToolType can be run from
           shell, Workbench, or set up as an appicon. Includes an option to sort
           the tooltypes alphabetically.  Version 37.210.  WB 2.0+ required.
           Binary only.  Author: Michael J Barsoom.